# [[ .AppName ]]

This workspace is an Eden Flutter-only app.

## Package Responsibilities

- `lib/` — Flutter application UI built on eden_platform_flutter and eden_ui_flutter

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `eden setup` | Install dependencies (flutter pub get) |
| `eden test` | Run all Flutter tests |
| `eden lint` | Run flutter analyze |
| `eden dev` | Start Flutter in watch mode |
| `eden check` | Run lint + test together |

## AI Guidance

- Use eden_platform_flutter for shell orchestration (auth, company loading, navigation)
- Use eden_ui_flutter for reusable UI widgets and tokens
- Do not hand-edit files under `lib/src/gen/` — they are auto-generated
